# M-package-manager step 5b (the coordinator's ruling of 2026-11-08): the
# entry's `git` names a folder of the program's own, on a machine whose PATH
# holds no git (the case's `environment`), so `heroes fetch` cannot know the
# program's repository and refuses the source, `no_git`. The build tells that,
# where it said *not placed: `heroes fetch` places it*.
use <yaml>/load  #~ no_git

function main()
    print(load.size())
